@@ -1,2 +1,20 @@
 # demo-target
 Tiny Node 24 project used as the sociotechnic dry-run target.
+
+## API
+
+### `greet(name)`
+
+Returns a greeting for `name`.
+
+```ts
+greet("sociotechnic"); // "Hello, sociotechnic"
+```
+
+### `farewell(name)`
+
+Returns a farewell for `name`.
+
+```ts
+farewell("sociotechnic"); // "Goodbye, sociotechnic"
+```
